{"title":"2025 CEMC Hypatia Problems/Problem 1c","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_1\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_Hypatia_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2025 CEMC Hypatia Problems/Problem 1\">Problem 1</a></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_Hypatia_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>To begin, tokens are distributed <i>unequally</i> between two people. Every minute following this, each person receives <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> more tokens.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_Hypatia_Problems/Problem_1c&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>A total of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/9/e59e2c6e83eb78cca610a5fd4070ae01c8d4ae60.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$100$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"29\" height=\"14\" /> tokens are distributed between Essi and Francis, with Essi receiving <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/f/edf074831eb5bc9e61d6d6e09f525a86e3068f6a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> tokens. After <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/d/e0d2bf360290fd61d1c1557e763f2622363b3d35.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$t$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"8\" height=\"13\" /> minutes, Francis has <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> times as many tokens as Essi. Determine the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/d/e0d2bf360290fd61d1c1557e763f2622363b3d35.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$t$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"8\" height=\"13\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_Hypatia_Problems/Problem_1c&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Since Francis and Essi started with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/9/e59e2c6e83eb78cca610a5fd4070ae01c8d4ae60.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$100$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"29\" height=\"14\" /> tokens in total and Essi started with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/d/96dcc757fdfbc8dc030bff07b787508599261001.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$12 tokens$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"73\" height=\"14\" />,Francis started with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/c/bcc8591f63460fce4f85b9aaac05ca632d0283da.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$100 - 12 = 88$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"112\" height=\"15\" /> tokens.\n</p><p>Since each person receives <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> more tokens per minute, each person would have had <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/6/5/f65450756c44b33df63c304f031fdfc2751a0d56.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2t$\" width=\"15\" height=\"12\" /> more tokens than what they started with after <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/d/e0d2bf360290fd61d1c1557e763f2622363b3d35.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$t$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"8\" height=\"13\" /> minutes. This means that Francis would end up with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/8/7c8355ccdf073cc29a9f76cd3e0f3c1c595da312.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2t + 88$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"58\" height=\"15\" /> tokens, while Essi would end up with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/a/d/bad462c91cd2fce89a2f97026d1dea82dc83887b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2t + 12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"58\" height=\"15\" /> tokens.\n</p><p>Since Francis ended up with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> times as many tokens as Essi, we have\n\\begin{align*}\n\t2t + 88 &amp;= 3(2t + 12)\\\\\n\t&amp;= 3 \\cdot 2t + 3 \\cdot 12\\\\\n\t&amp;= 6t + 36\\\\\n\t6t - 2t &amp;= 88 - 36\\\\\n\t4t &amp;= 52\\\\\n\tt &amp;= \\frac{52}{4} = \\boxed{13}.\n\\end{align*}\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018032259\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.013 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.030 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 65/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 243/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2573/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    6.549      1 2025_CEMC_Hypatia_Problems/Problem_1\n100.00%    6.549      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:36312:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018032259 and revision id 281369. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}